[statement]
A requested package with a single candidate is installed first, and a name
it provides needs nothing more: asked for `x` and `p1`, which provides `x` at
1.0, apk installs `p1` alone, not `x`.

[repository]
P:x
V:1.0

P:p1
V:1
p:x=1.0


[request]
x
p1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
